        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "limits-of-the-preview",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "A dream realm can later develop on its own and create new characters that the Gu did not preview.",
        "chapters": [
          2146
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "limits-of-the-preview",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Dream butterfly Immortal Gu remains an investigative Gu; Fang Yuan soon learns the details of a heaven path dream realm with it.",
