  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "During immortal ascension of the pure dream clone, the clone tosses a rank five dream butterfly mortal Gu, its vital Gu, into the remaining heaven and earth qi. From natural inspiration it learns three dream path Immortal Gu recipes, and dream butterfly Immortal Gu is one of them. Dream butterfly Immortal Gu becomes rank six, giving Fang Yuan four dream path Immortal Gu in total.",
        "chapters": [
          2090
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_vital_gu",
          "sys_gu_recipe",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Meng Qiu Zhen secretly activates dream butterfly Immortal Gu. After it is instilled with immortal essence, it vanishes from within his immortal aperture. Almost all other paths’ Gu cannot be used freely in dream realms, but dream path Gu are not restricted. Dream butterfly Immortal Gu is an investigative Gu worm, and its use in exploring dream realms surpasses Dream Armor and Dream Creation. When instincts fail, Meng Qiu Zhen uses it to foresee future possibilities of the dream realm, avoid danger, and find appropriate methods, instead of testing choices one by one as Fang Yuan’s main body once did.",
        "chapters": [
          2095
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "dream-realm-investigation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_meng_qiu_zhen",
          "sys_investigative_gu",
          "gu_dream_armor_gu",
          "gu_dream_creation_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Meng Qiu Zhen activates dream butterfly Immortal Gu secretly while stalling, and it finishes investigating a dream realm with eight scenes. Even though it can only investigate the situation, the value of that information is priceless.",
        "chapters": [
          2118
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "initiative-in-scenes",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Exploring Paradise Earth’s dream realm as a mushroomman disguise, Meng Qiu Zhen secretly activates dream butterfly Immortal Gu and learns from it that a black bear is the stage’s hardest obstacle, letting him choose tiger poison Gu in advance. When the stage fails to end as expected, he doubts himself, since dream butterfly Immortal Gu should already have scouted everything.",
        "chapters": [
          2143
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "paradise-earth-dream-stage",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable",
          "sys_poison_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
